---
// "Readable, more coming…" at the very bottom of an article or story card, under a thin line.
// Shown when the Main text has an inserted Coming soon / Nothing here yet card (the page is partly ready).
// Not shown when the whole page is set to a notice (the card then has its own "Coming soon" tag).
---
<p class="card-wip"><svg class="card-wip-logo" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#nl-base" width="100%" height="100%" /></svg>Readable, more coming…</p>

<style is:global>
  /* Thin line above, centred, body font, muted */
  .card .card-wip {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .4rem;
    margin: .8rem 0 0; padding-top: .55rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font: 400 .85rem var(--body); color: var(--muted);
  }
  .card-wip-logo { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; color: var(--water); flex: none; }
  /* Without a photo it still sits at the bottom of the card */
  a.card:has(.card-wip):not(:has(.card-photo)) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
</style>
